        <activityName xml:lang="en">Electricity, hydropower, at pumped storage plant, ENTSO, winter 2018</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Electricity, hydropower, at pumped storage plant, ENTSO, winter 2018
The electricity used to run the pump storage power plant is modelled by a specific electricity mix used for the operation of storage pumps in France in winter 2018.;
UUID: 5ad22b27-614a-3413-8f83-e0df7a12277e
This dataset includes the shares of different technologies of the electricity mix used for the operation of storage pumps in France.
Location: France
Technology: Average technology
Time period: Time of publications
Production volume: na
Sampling: Statistics 
Extrapolations: Some generic datasets from ecoinvent have been used.
Uncertainty adjustments: None
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_5ad22b27-614a-3413-8f83-e0df7a12277e.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
